<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Sharp upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sharp upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fator Securities said in a report that it has upgraded to buy from hold its recommendation on Brazilian electronics firm Sharp S.A..</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said consumer electronics manufacturing is a promising sector due to economic stability and greater buying power brought about by the Real anti-inflation plan.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Sharp is one of the companies with the best growth potential in this competitive sector,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
